# Large files kept in Git but NOT uploaded to Vercel with every deploy (they filled the
# Hobby plan's 10 GB Deployment Storage: ~95 MB per deploy x 87 deploys).
# PixelShrink loads these from GitHub / jsDelivr instead (see tools/pixelshrink/bg.js).
tools/pixelshrink/isnet.part*.wasm
tools/pixelshrink/ort-wasm-simd-threaded.wasm
tools/pixelshrink/ort-wasm-simd-threaded.mjs
# Work PDFs are served from the static-assets branch via jsDelivr (redirects in vercel.json).
work/*/*.pdf
